'''Lust for Battle''' (戦闘狂の集い, ''Sentōkyō no Tsudoi'', '''Gathering of Battle Enthusiasts''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

